  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C/#flush-autofocus-candidates\r\n> 5.8. If URL's fragment of any Document in inclusiveAncestorDocuments is not empty, then continue.\r\n\r\n[crbug.com/1046357](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1046357#c6):\r\n> However, this breaks a lot of webaps relying on the # character for front-end routes (like the default hasbang mode in AngularJS or Ionic routes).\r\n\r\nWe should check existence of [the indicated part of the document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C/#the-indicated-part-of-the-document) ?\r\n\r\n",
